From c46c70c24a8a5257b4127de4ecb69b75d1eab8c4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 13:41:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Separate main products from accessories; port 8010 with
 busy-port check

- Categories regrouped into Main products (basin, bidet, shower and bath mixers,
  shower heads, hand showers) and Accessories (shower arms, hoses/outlets/holders,
  waste/traps/valves, towel holders, paper holders, shelves/mirrors)
- Category always follows the product type; existing databases are migrated at start-up
- Proposal deck: separate slides per room for main products and accessories, grouped price summary
- Range deck: group divider slides, one category per overview slide
- Replace-with only offers products of the same category
- start.bat/start.sh default to port 8010 and move to the next free port if it's taken

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012YX2E1bvKbWAmZotn6sMbd
